# Code owners for privileged paths (Issue #2606).
#
# Review routing only: code-owner review is NOT required (infra/rulesets/
# main.json sets require_code_owner_review false). The fleet reviewer is a
# GitHub App, which can never be a code owner, so its approval is the gate
# and a PR that removes or loosens tests is held for the owner (THREAT-MODEL
# R14). The owners below are still requested as reviewers on these paths.
# The worker bot identities (stservice, VibeCoderST) stay absent.
#
# Last matching pattern wins. Guarded by worker/deno/tests/codeowners_test.ts.

# Workflows, composite actions, CI scripts and scanner config — every
# change here can alter what runs with repository credentials.
/.github/                @nleck @Green-Beret

# Branch ruleset definitions — the merge policy itself.
/infra/rulesets/         @nleck @Green-Beret
